{"id":120830646396899,"name":"[AIKU] Project: Blue Lock","desc":"⭐ WEEKLY UPDATES EVERY TUESDAY & FRIDAY! ⭐\n\n50k Favourites for CODE!\n150k Upvotes for BONUS CODE!\n\nWelcome to Project Blue Lock!\n\nAre you ready to test your skills and compete in the most intense and thrilling soccer challenges? In here you’re part of a revolutionary training program designed to find the world's best striker. Compete in fast-paced soccer matches, improve your skills, and rise through the ranks to become the ultimate goal-scorer!\n\n⚽ Features:\n\nCompete in a challenging 5v5 match\nUnlock unique character skins, abilities, and more\nWill you make it to the top of Blue Lock and claim the title of the ultimate striker? Show your skills, dominate the field, and become the legend you’re destined to be!\n\n⚙️ Controls:\n\nW, A, S, D – Move your player around\nSpacebar – Jump\nShift – Sprint \nG – Awaken\nQ – Request Ball\nLMB – Shoot/Pass\nE - Tackle\nF - Dribble\n\nJOIN THE GROUP FOR CODES!\n\nTags: Blue Lock, Football, Soccer, Team Sports, TPS, MPS, Futbol","path":"/game/120830646396899-project-blue-lock","slug":"120830646396899-project-blue-lock","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/59f67e4c572650d3cf49f8fffe65b9f960159cb8835311211f778342965ebd5c.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-807c67ae72a0be183c1b09dbfe35da2e/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":8,"visitor":15672868,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-06-29T13:03:34.976Z","creator":{"name":"BLOXMASTERZ","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"totalPages":1,"scripts":[{"_id":"686139a6c1924cae59a7a2fa","title":"Awakened","game":{"_id":"686139a6c1924cae59a7a2f0","gameId":120830646396899,"name":"[AIKU] Project: Blue Lock","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"slug":"120830646396899-project-blue-lock","path":"/game/120830646396899-project-blue-lock","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.we